Without an index:
  by author       SCAN books; USE TEMP B-TREE FOR ORDER BY
  newest          SCAN books; USE TEMP B-TREE FOR ORDER BY
  one author      SCAN books
  part of a name  SCAN books
With indexes on author and year:
  by author       SCAN books USING INDEX books_author; USE TEMP B-TREE FOR LAST TERM OF ORDER BY
  newest          SCAN books USING INDEX books_year; USE TEMP B-TREE FOR LAST TERM OF ORDER BY
  one author      SEARCH books USING INDEX books_author (author=?)
  part of a name  SCAN books
